  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 845811,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## James Bond 007: A View to a Kill (MSX) - Synopsis\n\nExperience the thrills of James Bond in *A View to a Kill* for the MSX! This action-packed game, inspired by the iconic film, plunges you into a race against time to thwart Zorin's nefarious plot. The game is divided into three distinct sections, each offering unique gameplay challenges.\n\nThe adventure begins in Paris, where you commandeer a taxi to pursue May Day after her daring parachute jump from the Eiffel Tower, navigating roadblocks and police cars in a frantic chase. Next, assist Stacey Sutton in escaping the burning San Francisco City Hall, collecting vital items like keys and water to overcome obstacles. Finally, delve into Zorin’s mine, dodging rockfalls and perilous drops while searching for the code to disarm his deadly bomb.\n\nFeaturing a moving gunsight intro sequence and a scanner displaying May Day's height, the MSX version delivers a visually engaging experience. While the MSX version omits the first two sections of the original action game, it still provides a compelling Bond adventure."
    },
